flowchart TB
    subgraph discovery["Discoverable skill catalog / Files own canonical bodies"]
        library["Canonical file library / Separate generic, app_core and workflow / Exclude _pending from ordinary active indexes"]
        device["Device and interface filter / interface_scope and device_profiles / Apply the same profile to catalog, reads and bodies"]
        catalog["Compact cards first / Expose enabled workflows and applicability / Task aliases and exact foreground affect priority"]
    end
    subgraph selection["Stage and app scope / Separate goal and foreground identity"]
        stage["Planner stage selection / Resolve target app and select exact IDs / At most 4 IDs, including at most 2 workflows"]
        core["Target and foreground core / Add exact foreground core to target guidance / Retire on exit; never rewrite target or workflow"]
        scope["Explicit delivery scope / Planner owns workflows; Executor cannot replace / Exact-ID generic reads; clear scope on device change"]
    end
    subgraph delivery["Progressive role delivery / Guidance, reads and recipes differ"]
        roleBody["Role body projection / Shared body plus Executor notes / Decision notes only for Planner/Reviewer"]
        references["On-demand references / Mentioning another skill never loads it / References enter context only through explicit reads"]
        recipes["Closed compound recipes / Active app skills may grant verified_actions / Match stage and foreground; retain child evidence"]
    end
    subgraph shared["Contracts and boundaries / Cross-stage constraints and traceability"]
        deliveryRecord["Auditable delivery identity / Record ID, version, body/projection hashes, scope and delivery source separately"]
        knowledgeBoundary["Knowledge and action boundary / Guidance grants no user consent; loading is not adoption; recipes exclude arbitrary scripts"]
    end
    library --> device
    device --> catalog
    discovery --> selection
    selection --> delivery
